**SigninLogs**:
This query is designed to retrieve sign-in logs for a specific user, identified by their UserPrincipalName, from the past 30 days. 
It selects the following information for each log entry, which can be useful for auditing sign-in activities and analyzing user access patterns

SigninLogs
| where UserPrincipalName contains "USERPRINCIPALNAME"
| where TimeGenerated > ago(30d)
| project UserDisplayName, OperationName, Category, Resource, Identity, IPAddress, LocationDetails, Type
